Package: ccreds
Title: Feature Selection in Censored-Covariate Regression Models
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Rajan", "Shankar", email = "rajan.shankar@sydney.edu.au",
           role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Tanya", "Garcia", role = "aut"),
    person("John", "Ormerod", role = "aut"),
    person("Garth", "Tarr", role = "aut")
  )
Description: Implements a penalised observed-data log-likelihood method for
    feature selection in censored-covariate regression models. Uses two
    separate L1 penalties to select features associated with the response
    variable and features associated with the censored covariate, via an
    Expectation-Minimisation (EM) algorithm. Tuning parameters are chosen
    by cross-validation.
